red.com/publisher/nisa"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Ys","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/Ys"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"Embark on a high seas adventure rich with action and exploration in Ys X: Nordics! Experience the perils of Obelia Gulf through the eyes of Adol Christin and his unexpected ally, the pirate Karja Balta, as they help save the people of the gulf from the mysterious immortal monsters known as the Griegr.\r\n\r\n[h2]Feature List[/h2]\r\n[b]Two Heroes, One Story:[/b] Bound by unexpected circumstances, the young adventurer Adol and the Norman pirate Karja must work together to determine the fate of Obelia Gulf and its people.\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/01200a4c65d5931d8ff26a31f4cd6fb0.poster.avif?t=1759432051\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/01200a4c65d5931d8ff26a31f4cd6fb0.webm?t=1759432051\" width=\"616\" height=\"302\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[b]Cross Action System:[/b] Swap between controlling Adol and Karja independently or together. Combine their unique strengths to overcome enemies, and build up the Revenge Gauge to unleash devastating attacks.\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/d0d30b04c9749f3722c0414d326ae17d.poster.avif?t=1759432051\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/d0d30b04c9749f3722c0414d326ae17d.webm?t=1759432051\" width=\"616\" height=\"302\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[b]The Power of Mana:[/b] Harness the unique abilities of Mana to overcome challenges. Grapple and slide through dungeons, demolish obstacles, create new platforms, and uncover hidden treasures and critical points.\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/17d2f5859cc82924863d73dacdfbc279.poster.avif?t=1759432051\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/17d2f5859cc82924863d73dacdfbc279.webm?t=1759432051\" width=\"616\" height=\"302\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[b]Sailor’s Delight:[/b] The sailing ship known as the Sandras takes your exploration to new levels. Ocean travel, naval battles, and discovering uncharted islands are all made possible with this seaworthy vessel.\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/bbdd4f7daba1f384ef1e75424586c7be.poster.avif?t=1759432051\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731870/extras/bbdd4f7daba1f384ef1e75424586c7be.webm?t=1759432051\" width=\"616\" height=\"302\"][/imgvid]","strSnippet":"Explore uncharted islands, engage in fast-paced action combat, and experience the high seas adventures of unlikely allies Adol and Karja in Ys X: Nordics!"}}],["achievements",{"version":2,"data":{"vecHighlight":[],"vecUnachieved":[{"strID":"TROPHY_TALK_ON_SHIP","strName":"Shoot the Breeze","strDescription":"Listened to a shipboard conversation between crewmates via the Action Menu.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2731870/71ca44eb49c9b8e9134748c4d03cd1196030dd70.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":81.19999694824219,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_AVORDAGE_S_RANK","strName":"Rapturous Recapture","strDescription":"Received an S-rank after clearing a Recapture.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2731870/dcdf9d36a526af393ef60a009212d4fd3e2a8c06.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":67,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_SPEED_ATTACK_COUNT","strName":"Elusive Evader","strDescription":"Evaded 100 Speed Attacks.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2731870/9f04a01920050b6ea1f2b242ed05899cf0977d42